# CODEOWNERS - the required-approver list, enforced natively by GitHub.
#
# Every PR into a branch whose protection enables "require code owner review"
# (development, staging, main) must have an approving review from one of the
# people below. The file is identical on every branch, so there is no drift to
# manage across promotions.
#
# GitHub blocks approving your own PR, so while this list has a single owner the
# author needs a second reviewer added here (or the branch rule relaxed).
* @capelloorion
